      "name": "Official Post Editorial Desk",
      "affiliation": "Official Post (officialpost.org)"
    }
  ],
  "description": "<p>Automated open news corpus (CSV, JSONL, Frictionless Data Package, Wikidata QuickStatements, and per-jurisdiction Markdown desk directories) of <a href='https://www.officialpost.org/'><strong>Official Post</strong></a> (https://www.officialpost.org), indexing <strong>229</strong> plain-English regulatory, legislative, and central bank news dispatches across <strong>20</strong> jurisdictions and <strong>99</strong> issuing authorities, reported directly from primary documents in <a href='https://www.indexdata.org/'>Index Data</a>. Mirrored across Harvard Dataverse (<a href='https://doi.org/10.7910/DVN/XLW59A'>10.7910/DVN/XLW59A</a>), Figshare (<a href='https://doi.org/10.6084/m9.figshare.34960054'>10.6084/m9.figshare.34960054</a>), OSF (<a href='https://osf.io/e7j3k/'>https://osf.io/e7j3k/</a>), Hugging Face (<a href='https://huggingface.co/datasets/Schtumpfnagel/officialpost-news-index'>officialpost-news-index</a>), GitHub (<a href='https://github.com/Schtumpfnagel/officialpost-news-index'>officialpost-news-index</a>), and Wikidata (<a href='https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q142090813'>Q142090813</a>).</p>",
